From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nick Chan <towinchenmi@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 13:15:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: mailbox: apple,mailbox: Add the A7-A8X ANS
 mailbox

The storage coprocessor (ANS) of the A7, A8 and A8X talks through an AKF
mailbox with the A7 IOP register layout and 64-bit message packing.

[Orchard: from HoolockLinux/linux ans1 ed8528f (38048006727d, 69243a528954), reconciled in
mattonik/ipad-nixos b94d42f and micro23/ipadair2-omarchy 7ea2b2b; one
description for both compatibles, the T8015 description as in Hoolock.]
Signed-off-by: Nick Chan <towinchenmi@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: ricktav <82380971+ricktav@users.noreply.github.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../bindings/mailbox/apple,mailbox.yaml          | 16 +++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/apple,mailbox.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/apple,mailbox.yaml
index ea414a8f4..4529d58e8 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/apple,mailbox.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/apple,mailbox.yaml
@@ -35,9 +35,10 @@ properties:
           - const: apple,asc-mailbox-v4
 
       - description:
-          An older ASC mailbox interface found on T2 and A11 that is also
-          used for the NVMe coprocessor and the system management
-          controller.
+          The oldest ASC mailbox interface as well as a 96-bit variant
+          of the AKF mailbox with similar behaviours are found on T2 and
+          A11 and is used for the NVMe coprocessor and system management
+          coprocessor.
         items:
           - const: apple,t8015-asc-mailbox
 
@@ -65,6 +66,15 @@ properties:
           - const: apple,s8000-a7iop-mailbox
           - const: apple,t8010-a7iop-mailbox
 
+      - description:
+          The AKF mailbox of the A7 to A8X storage (ANS) coprocessor. It has
+          the A7 IOP register layout and 64-bit message packing.
+        items:
+          - enum:
+              - apple,t7000-akf-mailbox-v1
+              - apple,s5l8960x-akf-mailbox-v1
+          - const: apple,akf-mailbox-v1
+
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
 
